<template id="promo-wallet-template">
  <section class="promo-wallet-card" id="promo-wallet-card" aria-labelledby="promo-wallet-title">
    <div class="promo-wallet-intro"><span class="section-kicker">A LITTLE EXTRA / CREDIT CODES</span><h2 id="promo-wallet-title">Got a credit code<span>?</span></h2><p>Adds to your available wallet for staking or withdrawals. The $100 withdrawal minimum, identity verification and administrator review apply.</p></div>
    <div class="promo-wallet-action" id="promo-wallet-action"></div>
    <div class="promo-message" id="promo-redeem-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <div class="promo-history" id="promo-history" hidden><div class="promo-history-heading"><h3>Your redeemed codes</h3><button class="promo-text-button" type="button" data-promo-history-refresh>Refresh history ↻</button></div><div id="promo-history-list"></div><div class="promo-pagination" id="promo-history-pagination" hidden><button type="button" data-promo-history-page="previous">← Previous</button><span id="promo-history-page"></span><button type="button" data-promo-history-page="next">Next →</button></div></div>
  </section>
</template>

<template id="promo-admin-template">
  <section class="admin-tab-panel" id="admin-promos-tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="admin-tab-promos" hidden>
    <div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">A CREDIT TO THE COMMUNITY / PROMOTIONS</span><h2>Give the next edge<span>.</span></h2><p>Create a single-use credit code. Anyone holding an active code can redeem its value into their wallet.</p></div><button class="button outline" id="promo-admin-refresh" type="button">Refresh codes <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></button></div>
    <div class="promo-admin-layout"><section class="promo-create-card" aria-labelledby="promo-create-title"><span class="section-kicker">16 CHARACTERS. ONE CREDIT.</span><h3 id="promo-create-title">Make it count<span>.</span></h3><p>Credit is available for staking and withdrawal requests after redemption. Codes are generated securely when you create them.</p><form id="promo-create-form" autocomplete="off"><label class="promo-field"><span>Credit amount (USD)</span><div class="promo-amount-input"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input name="amount" type="text" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="25.00" required maxlength="10" pattern="[0-9]+([.][0-9]{1,2})?" aria-describedby="promo-amount-hint"></div><small id="promo-amount-hint">$1.00–$1,000,000.00 · up to two decimal places</small></label><label class="promo-field"><span>Promotion label <small>(optional)</small></span><input name="label" maxlength="100" placeholder="For example, season launch"><small>Shown in the user’s credit history.</small></label><label class="promo-field"><span>Expiry <small>(optional, your local time)</small></span><input name="expires_at" type="datetime-local"><small>Leave blank for a code with no expiry.</small></label><label class="promo-field"><span>Your admin password</span><input name="current_password" type="password" required maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password"><small>Confirm before creating withdrawable wallet credit.</small></label><div class="promo-message error" id="promo-create-message" role="alert" hidden></div><button class="button green" id="promo-create-submit" type="submit">Create credit code <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></button></form></section><div class="promo-admin-main"><section class="promo-issued" id="promo-issued" hidden aria-labelledby="promo-issued-title" aria-live="polite"></section><div class="promo-list-toolbar"><label class="promo-field"><span>Show codes</span><select id="promo-admin-status"><option value="all">All codes</option><option value="active">Active</option><option value="redeemed">Redeemed</option><option value="revoked">Revoked</option><option value="expired">Expired</option></select></label><span id="promo-admin-count"></span></div><div class="promo-message error" id="promo-admin-message" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="promo-admin-list" id="promo-admin-list"></div><div class="promo-pagination" id="promo-admin-pagination" hidden><button type="button" data-promo-admin-page="previous">← Previous</button><span id="promo-admin-page"></span><button type="button" data-promo-admin-page="next">Next →</button></div></div></div>
    <p class="promo-admin-note">Created codes carry wallet value. Share the full code privately with its intended recipient. Revoking an unused code prevents redemption and does not remove a credit already redeemed.</p>
  </section>
</template>

<div class="promo-dialog-backdrop" id="promo-revoke-dialog" hidden><section class="promo-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="promo-revoke-title"><button class="promo-close" type="button" data-promo-revoke-close aria-label="Close revoke confirmation">×</button><span class="section-kicker">STOP AN UNUSED CODE</span><h2 id="promo-revoke-title">Revoke this code<span>?</span></h2><p id="promo-revoke-description"></p><form id="promo-revoke-form" autocomplete="off"><label class="promo-field"><span>Your admin password</span><input type="password" name="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"></label><label class="promo-confirm"><input name="confirmed" type="checkbox" required><span>I understand this code will no longer be redeemable.</span></label><div class="promo-message error" id="promo-revoke-message" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="promo-dialog-actions"><button class="button outline" type="button" data-promo-revoke-close>Keep code</button><button class="button green" type="submit" id="promo-revoke-submit">Revoke code <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></div></form></section></div>
